# CHIME CIRCUIT: floors, ceilings and walls all hurt. A ship that touches
# one loses a hit point (three to a ship) and bounces back off it; for
# three quarters of a second after, nothing hurts it again. The third
# lost hit point wrecks it.
seed 1
game chime
wait 30
cheat race 1
cheat park_cpus
cheat go
expect hp0 == 3
# up into the ceiling
cheat place 0 140 22
cheat vel 0 0 -500
waituntil walls0 >= 1 30
expect hp0 == 2
expect vy0 > 0
expect mercy0 > 40
expect alive0 == 1
# down onto the floor while it's still flashing: no harm
waituntil walls0 >= 2 60
expect hp0 == 2
# after that, every touch counts
waituntil hp0 == 1 300
waituntil alive0 == 0 300
expect wrecks0 == 1
expect hp0 == 0
